<title>MEXICO: GMD Q3 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>GMD Q3 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr   profit	   1.31     loss	 7.35</p>
<p>	Net   profit	 59.25 million   loss     332.63 million</p>
<p>	Revs		  243.29 million	     301.21 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos under U.S. GAAP.</p>
<p>GMD is traded as American Depositary Receipts and each ADR is equivalent to one share on the Mexican bolsa.</p>
<p>Full company name is Grupo Mexicano de Desarrollo SA</p>
